:"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxOZ1RwNjBnLVlmbF9NWGhPald1LXhNRkY0cHVVZUE3NnN4YUc2SDVMRjBVWXFPUlg4STBHcGdnanVTWXozOU5yb25oZVBROEdvU2k1QkZCQm0wVzBNaHYyc3AydTd6dVd2Q1JWS1dXWnphSG9abWhkNHF2ZUlETzZvOHdEcWkwX19BQjc1ZzczZXdSNk0yRnh6QUhrVHdFdFVzam5GdEUwcjg2cDBYU3ZlbjcwOHBhTlhndGtyenYwdTFGLWxFN0E?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"恩智浦半導體 (NXPI) 在第三季指引後面臨股價下跌，Div"},{"title":"Why is NXP Semiconductors stock sliding today?","src":"Investing.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNaFJFUThIaVM3R3pnbkhvN3p4TGxPMEV5ZFBaQTg4M28tVEdDWkJWRFMtNnllZmlUQUsxZGFFOWJCU3pBTFA4eFp3V2xsQXM0ZEFhY2RNVk9uX3NxckZTeW5LSEE3QVBMVlB4Qmo1UU5nbnVvckt6R0FVQWF5dlhldTRLaS1ScjhuejlsSjMzeGNGbWg2dTBoSC1xQ1hfQmx3cXZLdzM3UEJqSE0?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"為什麼恩智浦半導體的股價今天會下跌？"},{"title":"U.S. Stock Market Update | Fourth-quarter revenue guidance slightly below expectations; NXP Semiconductors (NXPI.US) falls nearly 6% in early trading","src":"Moomoo","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOSEI0SS1teDVpdlU3NjJCOXQ3bTZtdUtrY0ZRZ2kzNlQtNkdXUmd1ZWJjMU1QaV9JdVFOa1hWd3I3SDBBREtLUFI0UzhIWEtoUTBYMy14NlJCbzNLWXRXdklVSUpDU3hNODVhcmtPZHdSSTlmSTNZd3V2a0NXeUdXdW8yMGhtWEx3bmZUbWxuemo5QXpHS0RfTGFNM1NJRTV4ajRpVl9OOWhJX0JmazFqWExjYw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"美國股市動態 |第四季營收指引略低於預期；恩智浦半導體 (NXPI.US) 早盤下跌近 6%"}],"themes":[{"name":"半導體/晶片","count":19},{"name":"財報","count":9},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-19","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1413447/000141344726000008/nxpi-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"NXP Semiconductors N.V. is a global semiconductor company and a long-standing supplier in the industry, with over 70 years of innovation and operating history. For the year ended December 31, 2025, we generated revenue of $12,269 million, compared to $12,614 million for the year ended December 31, 2024.","zh":"NXP Semiconductors N.V. 是一家全球性半導體公司，也是業界的長期供應商，擁有 70 多年的創新和營運歷史。截至2025年12月31日止年度，我們的收入為122.69億美元，而截至2024年12月31日止年度為126.14億美元。"},{"en":"We provide leading solutions that leverage our combined portfolio of intellectual property, deep application knowledge, process technology and manufacturing expertise in the domains of embedded processing, mixed-signal analog-digital (mixed A/D), power management, digital signal processing, cryptography-security, high-speed interface, radio frequency (RF), and embedded system design. Our product solutions are used in a wide range of end market applications including: automotive, industrial & Internet of Things (IoT), mobile, and communication infrastructure. We engage with leading global companies and sell products in all major geographic regions.","zh":"我们提供领先的解决方案，充分利用我们在嵌入式处理、混合信号模数（混合 A/D）、电源管理、数字信号处理、加密安全、高速接口、射频 (RF) 和嵌入式系统设计领域的知识产权、深厚的应用知识、工艺技术和制造专业知识的综合组合。我們的產品解決方案廣泛用於終端市場應用，包括：汽車、工業和物聯網 (IoT)、行動和通訊基礎設施。我們與全球領先的公司合作，並在所有主要地理區域銷售產品。"},{"en":"Our legal name is NXP Semiconductors N.V. and our commercial name is \"NXP\" or \"NXP Semiconductors.\" We were incorporated in the Netherlands in 2006 and are a Dutch public company with limited liability (naamloze vennootschap).","zh":"我們的法定名稱是 NXP Semiconductors N.V.，商業名稱是“NXP”或“NXP Semiconductors”。我們於 2006 年在荷蘭註冊成立，是一家荷蘭上市有限責任公司 (naamloze vennootschap)。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We offer customers a broad portfolio of semiconductor products for building advanced systems, including microcontrollers, application processors, communication processors, connectivity chipsets, analog and interface devices, RF power amplifiers, security controllers, sensors and foundational system middleware. Using our strong Automotive & Industrial portfolios, we are enhancing our product offerings by providing system solution platforms including safety case enablement and software defined vehicle (SDV) middleware for the growing ecosystems in & around vehicles, smart factories, robotics, homes and buildings. Enabling innovation at our customers as well as reducing complexity, integration efforts and shorten time to market is a key element of our strategy. We believe we have the broadest Arm processor portfolio in the industry, from microcontrollers to crossover processors and from app","zh":"我们为客户提供广泛的半导体产品组合，用于构建先进的系统，包括微控制器、应用处理器、通信处理器、连接晶片组、模拟和接口设备、射频功率放大器、安全控制器、传感器和基础系统中间件。借助我们强大的汽车和工业产品组合，我们通过提供系统解决方案平台（包括安全案例支持和软件定义车辆 (SDV) 中间件）来增强我们的产品组合，以适应车辆、智能工厂、机器人、家庭和建筑等不断发展的生态系统。促進客戶創新、降低複雜性、整合工作、縮短上市時間是我們策略的關鍵要素。我們相信我們擁有業界最廣泛的 Arm 處理器產品組合，從微控制器到交叉處理器，再到應用程式"},{"en":"We have been a provider of MCU solutions for more than 40 years. MCUs integrate all of the major components of a computing system onto a single semiconductor device. Typically, this includes a programmable processor core, memory, interface circuitry and other components. MCUs provide the digital logic, or intelligence, for electronic applications, controlling electronic equipment or analyzing sensor inputs. We are a trusted, long-term supplier of MCUs to many of our customers, especially in the automotive, smartcards, industrial and consumer markets. Our MCU product portfolio ranges from 8-bit products to higher performance 16-bit and 32-bit products with on-board flash memory. Our portfolio is highly scalable, and is coupled with our extensive software and design tools. This enables our customers to design-in and deploy our MCU families, leveraging a consistent software development envi","zh":"40 多年來，我們一直是 MCU 解決方案的提供者。 MCU 將計算系統的所有主要組件整合到單一半導體裝置上。通常，這包括可程式處理器核心、記憶體、介面電路和其他元件。 MCU 為電子應用提供數位邏輯或智能，控制電子設備或分析感測器輸入。我們是許多客戶值得信賴的長期 MCU 供應商，特別是在汽車、智慧卡、工業和消費市場。我們的 MCU 產品組合涵蓋從 8 位元產品到具有板載快閃記憶體的更高效能 16 位元和 32 位元產品。我們的產品組合具有高度可擴展性，並與我們廣泛的軟體和設計工具相結合。這使我們的客戶能夠利用一致的軟體開發環境來設計和部署我們的 MCU 系列"}],"customers":[{"en":"Our revenue is primarily the sum of our direct sales plus our sales to distributors. Avnet accounted for 23% of our revenue in 2025 and 22% in 2024. No other distributor accounted for greater than 10% of our revenue. No direct customer accounted for more than 10% of our revenue in 2025 or 2024.","zh":"我們的收入主要是直接銷售加上經銷商銷售的總和。安富利在 2025 年占我們營收的 23%，在 2024 年佔 22%。沒有其他經銷商占我們收入的 10% 以上。 2025 年或 2024 年，沒有直接客戶占我們收入的 10% 以上。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We compete with many different semiconductor companies on a global basis, including with both integrated device manufacturers (\"IDMs\") as well as fabless companies. Nearly all our competitors invest extensively in research and development, manufacturing, sales and marketing capabilities across a broad spectrum of product lines. Many of our competitors are focused on single applications or market segments. Most of our competitors compete with us with respect to some, but not all, of our product lines.","zh":"我們在全球範圍內與許多不同的半導體公司競爭，包括整合裝置製造商（“IDM”）以及無晶圓廠公司。幾乎我們所有的競爭對手都在廣泛的產品線的研發、製造、銷售和行銷能力方面進行了大量投資。我們的許多競爭對手都專注於單一應用或細分市場。我們的大多數競爭對手在我們的部分（但不是全部）產品線上與我們競爭。"},{"en":"Our primary key public competitors in alphabetical order include, but are not limited to, Analog Devices Inc., Broadcom Inc., Infineon Technologies AG, Microchip Technology Inc., Qualcomm Inc., Renesas Electronics Corp., STMicroelectronics NV and Texas Instruments Inc.","zh":""}],"segments":{"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":3221000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"DE","val":2369000000,"zh":"德國"},{"name":"CN","val":2036000000,"zh":"中國"},{"name":"JP","val":1059000000,"zh":"日本"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":1024000000,"zh":"其他國家"},{"name":"KR","val":889000000,"zh":"韓國"},{"name":"TW","val":874000000,"zh":"台灣"},{"name":"SG","val":714000000,"zh":"新加坡"},{"name":"NL","val":83000000,"zh":"荷蘭"}],"total":12269000000}},"peers":["ON","SWKS","ADI","MCHP","LRCX"]}}